 "answer_verbatim": "There isn’t one objectively “best” company, but **Estes Services** looks like a strong all-around choice for an AC replacement: it has a long track record and thousands of highly rated customer reviews. **PV Heating, Cooling & Plumbing** and **Empire Heating & Air Conditioning** are also worth getting quotes from; local listings specifically include them for full system replacements.\n\nI’d get **three written estimates** before deciding. Ask each company to assess your home’s cooling needs—not just match the old unit’s size—and spell out the equipment, installation work, permits, warranty, and total price. Check that the contractor is properly licensed and insured, and compare the same scope of work across quotes. Ratings and rankings vary by source and location, so the best fit may depend on your part of metro Atlanta.",
